01:29.500 --> 01:32.860
So long as we can reverse by the end of the week, then all is right with the world.

01:32.980 --> 01:36.540
Based on the futures, it looks like the half cycle low is pretty much in effect.

01:36.860 --> 01:39.180
This, however, looks like we're about to do a third tour in Nasdaqistan.

01:39.980 --> 01:40.980
