01:41.040 --> 01:43.560
I think it's just going to backfill some gaps, as I'll show you in a moment.

01:43.560 --> 01:49.060
There was an initial knee-jerk reaction where the rates repriced to about 50-50.

01:49.300 --> 01:51.820
